/E ( In brief, our work demonstrates that various types of polaritons exhibit a robust, optically and electrically controllable nonlinear response in 2D materials. The resulting polaritonic nonlinearities provide a versatile platform for optical manipulation across multiple spectral regimes.)
/Pg 38 0 R
>>
