/E ( SiPM-based detectors are now widely used in medical imaging, nuclear and radiation physics, LIDAR, environmental monitoring, and advanced scientific and industrial systems. Our group actively contributes to international and regional projects in detector development, supporting both fundamental research and the transfer of innovative technologies into practical applications.)
