/E ( First, considering that the experimental area has not been studied in sufficient detail, that is, the absence of other information characterizing the fertility, it is accepted that the obtained parameters are subject to the law of normal distribution. The parameters characterizing the soil are divided into first and second orders according to their effect on fertility. A block diagram corresponding to these is compiled and a suitable model is given.)
